#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:1
msgid "Acknowledgments"
msgstr "Remerciements"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:3
msgid "Mathematical Foundation"
msgstr "Fondation mathématique"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:5
msgid ""
"**[solarsystem](https://github.com/IoannisNasios/solarsystem)** by "
"Ioannis Nasios — The pure Python astronomy library that inspired and "
"served as the mathematical foundation for Ketu's NumPy ephemeris engine. "
"Kepler's equation solver, perturbation terms, coordinate transformations,"
" and Moon calculations all trace back to this elegant, dependency-free "
"library. Thank you!"
msgstr ""
"**[solarsystem](https://github.com/IoannisNasios/solarsystem)** par "
"Ioannis Nasios — La bibliothèque Python pure d'astronomie qui a inspiré "
"et servi de fondation mathématique au moteur d'éphémérides NumPy de Ketu."
" Le solveur de l'équation de Kepler, les termes de perturbation, les "
"transformations de coordonnées et les calculs lunaires sont tous issus de"
" cette bibliothèque élégante et sans dépendance. Merci !"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:7
msgid "Collaboration"
msgstr "Collaboration"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:9
msgid ""
"**[Claude](https://claude.ai)** by Anthropic — The pure NumPy rewrite, "
"from orbital mechanics to aspect detection, was developed in "
"collaboration with Claude. Architecture, algorithms, tests, and "
"documentation were produced through extensive pair programming sessions. "
"This collaboration continued through v1.1 (configurable aspects, house "
"systems), v1.2 (charts, synastry, composite, returns, Arabic Parts), and "
"v1.3 (Chiron Chebyshev engine)."
msgstr ""
"**[Claude](https://claude.ai)** par Anthropic — La réécriture Pure "
"NumPy, de la mécanique orbitale à la détection d'aspects, a été "
"développée en collaboration avec Claude. L'architecture, les algorithmes,"
" les tests et la documentation ont été produits lors de nombreuses "
"sessions de pair programming. Cette collaboration s'est poursuivie avec "
"v1.1 (aspects configurables, systèmes de maisons), v1.2 (thèmes, "
"synastrie, thème composite, retours, Parties arabes) et v1.3 (moteur "
"Chiron Chebyshev)."

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:11
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "Workflow"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:13
msgid ""
"**[GSD (Get Shit Done)](https://github.com/gsd-build/get-shit-done)** — "
"The project management workflow that structured the development of Ketu "
"into phases with research, planning, execution, and verification steps. "
"Used throughout v1.0 through v1.3."
msgstr ""
"**[GSD (Get Shit Done)](https://github.com/gsd-build/get-shit-done)** — "
"Le workflow de gestion de projet qui a structuré le développement de Ketu"
" en phases avec des étapes de recherche, planification, exécution et "
"vérification. Utilisé tout au long des versions v1.0 à v1.3."

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:15
msgid "Other Influences"
msgstr "Autres influences"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:17
msgid "Original orbital calculations based on Paul Schlyter's work"
msgstr "Calculs orbitaux originaux basés sur les travaux de Paul Schlyter"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:18
msgid "Inspired by the accuracy and reliability of Swiss Ephemeris"
msgstr "Inspiré par la précision et la fiabilité de Swiss Ephemeris"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:19
msgid "Orb system based on Abu Ma'shar (787-886) and Al-Biruni (973-1050)"
msgstr "Système d'orbes basé sur Abu Ma'shar (787-886) et Al-Biruni (973-1050)"

#: ../../source/acknowledgments.md:20
msgid "Built with the power of NumPy for scientific computing"
msgstr "Construit avec la puissance de NumPy pour le calcul scientifique"

